      "Video Call: محادثة مرئية وصوتية (Zoom, Teams, Meet)",
      "Chat Rooms: محادثة جماعية (Discord, Slack)",
      "Social Media: Facebook, Twitter, Instagram, LinkedIn, TikTok",
